cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Single-cell Prep
abstract: 'The first step of the single-cell workflows: finds Cell Ranger (count, multi / Flex, ARC), AnnData and
  Seurat samples in a folder tree, joins SPARC dataset metadata or a sample sheet, and writes one raw-count AnnData
  file per sample with QC metrics, plus each sample''s raw droplet matrix and sample tables.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/sc-prep
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.1
